# Mapbox public access token (pk.*) — used by /dla-kierowcow and
# /dla-wlascicieli mobile mockups for real Mapbox map rendering.
# Get a token at https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens
# IMPORTANT: only the PUBLIC (pk.*) token belongs here. The SECRET (sk.*)
# token must NEVER be commited or shipped to the browser — it lives in
# CI/EAS Build secrets only.
PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN=pk.your_token_here
